# Blight triggers when Darksteel Citadel taps, but destruction leaves the indestructible land and its Aura intact (CR 702.12b).
[Bot1 Deck]
Blight
Mox Jet x2
Swamp x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Darksteel Citadel
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Darksteel Citadel.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Blight.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Darksteel Citadel)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Darksteel Citadel.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
